---
/**
 * The product shot: Obsidian with the Obelisk sidebar open, rebuilt in markup
 * rather than captured, so it stays sharp, follows the theme, and can be read
 * by a screen reader.
 */
---

<figure class="shot ob-grain">
	<div class="chrome">
		<div class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
		<div class="tab">Chapter 3.md</div>
		<div class="chrome-right"><span>†</span></div>
	</div>

	<div class="panes">
		<div class="note">
			<h2>Chapter 3</h2>
			<p>
				The rain had been falling <mark class="hl resolved">since noon</mark>,
				and by the time Marta reached the crossing{" "}
				<mark class="hl">the road had given up being a road</mark>.{" "}
				<mark class="hl active"
					>The horse, which had been standing there, bolted.</mark
				><span class="marker">†</span>
			</p>
			<p>
				She did not run after it. There was nothing at the far end worth
				arriving at in this weather, and the animal knew the way home better
				than she did.
			</p>
			<p>
				What she noticed, standing in the ruts with her boots filling, was how
				quiet it had gone. The rain took the sound out of everything, and the
				field on the other side of the wall had stopped being a field and
				become a flat grey thing with a fence in it.
			</p>
			<p class="dim">
				She counted to a hundred, which was what her mother had always done,
				and then she started walking —
			</p>
		</div>

		<aside class="sidebar">
			<header class="side-head">
				<div class="row">
					<span class="count">3 comments · 2 open</span>
					<span class="icons"><i>⌄</i><i>⋯</i></span>
				</div>
				<div class="chips">
					<button class="chip active" type="button">All</button>
					<button class="chip" type="button">Open</button>
					<button class="chip run" type="button"
						>claude-opus-5 <span class="x">×</span></button
					>
				</div>
			</header>

			<div class="cards">
				<article class="card sel">
					<div class="card-head">
						<span class="author">claude</span>
						<span class="badge">agent</span>
						<span class="date">2m</span>
					</div>
					<blockquote class="quote"
						>The horse, which had been standing there, bolted.</blockquote
					>
					<p class="body">
						The relative clause is doing no work here. It tells us the
						horse was where the horse was.
					</p>
					<div class="sugg">
						<div class="sugg-head">
							<span class="sugg-icon">±</span>
							<span class="sugg-title">Suggested edit</span>
							<span class="apply">Apply</span>
						</div>
						<div class="diff">
							<div class="del"
								>The horse<span class="w-del"
									>, which had been standing there,</span
								> bolted.</div
							>
							<div class="add">The horse bolted.</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="actions"
						><span>Reply</span><span>Resolve</span><span>Edit</span></div
					>
				</article>

				<article class="card">
					<div class="card-head">
						<span class="author">zach</span>
						<span class="date">Aug 29</span>
					</div>
					<blockquote class="quote">the road had given up being a road</blockquote>
					<p class="body">Keep this one. Everything else in the paragraph can go.</p>
					<div class="replies">
						<div class="card-head">
							<span class="author">claude</span>
							<span class="badge">agent</span>
							<span class="date">2m</span>
						</div>
						<p class="body">Left it alone. The cuts above are all in the next sentence.</p>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="card done">
					<div class="card-head">
						<span class="author">zach</span>
						<span class="date">Aug 29</span>
					</div>
					<blockquote class="quote">since noon</blockquote>
					<p class="body">Timeline disagrees with chapter 2.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</aside>
	</div>
</figure>

<style>
	.shot {
		background-color: var(--ob-ink-2);
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: var(--ob-radius);
		box-shadow: var(--ob-shadow);
		margin: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		position: relative;
	}

	.shot::after {
		border-radius: var(--ob-radius);
	}

	.chrome {
		align-items: center;
		background-color: var(--ob-raise);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
	}

	.lights {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.35rem;
	}

	.lights i {
		background-color: var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: 50%;
		height: 9px;
		width: 9px;
	}

	.tab {
		background-color: var(--ob-ink-2);
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		border-radius: 6px;
		color: var(--ob-text-2);
		font-family: var(--ob-sans);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		padding: 0.18rem 0.6rem;
	}

	.chrome-right {
		color: var(--ob-amber);
		font-family: var(--ob-display);
		margin-inline-start: auto;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}

	.panes {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 19rem;
		max-height: 34rem;
		min-height: 22rem;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	/* ── Note ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.note {
		border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		color: var(--ob-text);
		font-family: var(--ob-sans);
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		padding: 1.6rem 1.75rem;
	}

	.note h2 {
		font-family: var(--ob-display);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
	}

	.note p {
		margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
	}

	.note .dim {
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
	}

	.hl {
		background-color: transparent;
		border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ob-amber) 45%, transparent);
		border-radius: 2px;
		color: inherit;
	}

	.hl.active {
		background-color: var(--ob-amber-wash);
		border-bottom-color: var(--ob-amber);
	}

	.hl.resolved {
		border-bottom-style: dotted;
		border-bottom-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ob-amber) 30%, transparent);
	}

	.marker {
		color: var(--ob-amber);
		font-family: var(--ob-display);
		font-size: 0.85em;
		margin-inline-start: 2px;
		vertical-align: super;
	}

	/* ── Sidebar ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

	.sidebar {
		background-color: var(--ob-ink);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		font-family: var(--ob-sans);
		min-width: 0;
	}

	.side-head {
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem;
	}

	.row {
		align-items: center;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}

	.count {
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		font-size: 0.68rem;
	}

	.icons {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	.icons i {
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-style: normal;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.chips {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.3rem;
	}

	.chip {
		background: transparent;
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		font: inherit;
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		padding: 0.08rem 0.5rem;
	}

	.chip.active {
		border-color: var(--ob-amber);
		color: var(--ob-text);
	}

	.chip.run .x {
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		margin-inline-start: 0.25rem;
	}

	.cards {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.6rem;
	}

	.card {
		background-color: var(--ob-raise);
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 0.6rem;
	}

	.card.sel {
		border-color: var(--ob-amber);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--ob-amber);
	}

	.card.done {
		opacity: 0.6;
	}

	.card-head {
		align-items: center;
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		display: flex;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		gap: 0.35rem;
	}

	.author {
		color: var(--ob-text);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.date {
		margin-inline-start: auto;
	}

	.badge {
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		font-size: 0.62rem;
		padding: 0 0.3rem;
	}

	.badge.ok {
		background-color: var(--ob-green-wash);
		border-color: transparent;
		color: var(--ob-text);
	}

	.quote {
		border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--ob-amber);
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		margin: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-inline-start: 0.5rem;
	}

	.body {
		color: var(--ob-text-2);
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.replies {
		border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.3rem;
		margin-block-start: 0.6rem;
		padding-inline-start: 0.5rem;
	}

	.sugg {
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: 6px;
		margin-block-start: 0.6rem;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.sugg-head {
		align-items: center;
		background-color: var(--ob-raise-2);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		display: flex;
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.45rem;
	}

	.sugg-icon {
		color: var(--ob-green);
	}

	.sugg-title {
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.apply {
		background-color: var(--ob-raise);
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--ob-text);
		margin-inline-start: auto;
		padding: 0.05rem 0.4rem;
	}

	.diff {
		font-family: var(--ob-mono);
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.del,
	.add {
		padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
		white-space: pre-wrap;
	}

	.del {
		background-color: var(--ob-red-wash);
		border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--ob-red);
		color: var(--ob-text-2);
	}

	.add {
		background-color: var(--ob-green-wash);
		border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--ob-green);
		color: var(--ob-text-2);
	}

	.w-del {
		background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ob-red) 28%, transparent);
		text-decoration: line-through;
	}

	.w-add {
		background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ob-green) 28%, transparent);
	}

	.actions {
		color: var(--ob-text-3);
		display: flex;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-block-start: 0.6rem;
	}

	.actions span {
		border: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
	}

	/* Stacked, the height cap would spend the whole window on the note and
	   clip the sidebar off the bottom, so it lifts and the note gets shorter
	   instead. */
	@media (max-width: 60rem) {
		.panes {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			max-height: none;
		}

		.note {
			border-block-end: 1px solid var(--ob-line-soft);
			border-inline-end: 0;
		}

		.note p:nth-of-type(n + 3) {
			display: none;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 30rem) {
		.note {
			padding: 1.1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
